;" data-ref="0f66601a-b8eb-45b9-8692-34932613922a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="8f73c3b5-0b02-43ee-ad2e-428baa91d21c"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="834b1c2c-2507-4482-87d9-5cacb22a4de7"><p data-ref="395fbc36-e577-4389-a1a8-6b5d35db080f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to implement a Min Heap of integers. The program should first read a list of integers and insert them into the heap while maintaining the min-heap property. It should then read the number of deletions to perform, delete the root (minimum element) that many times, and display the heap both before and after the deletions.</p><p data-ref="136e636c-9c5a-4913-97ff-e4957c8e48e2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="da6245da-93e2-4275-baf2-2bf89bef77d2"></p><p data-ref="a2983b5a-7932-4d26-9b5a-b7711dc54549" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="f0585ed6-1147-407d-ba17-4bfbe82185d4">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="6beb239d-db5b-4ab8-8736-e38694df8a79" data-counter-list-1-rese