ayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="9a698635-f20e-4e9b-aaa1-82a3384b80e6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="0c2999d2-b1f0-4873-9744-e5950c4bfc69"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="185e3a9b-a662-4da4-8cf1-fc754dfddd6b"><p data-ref="e7637e57-c8be-42ac-bec9-1eb7dc4cff6e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">You are given <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="2917403a-e385-467d-9cc2-ffa32f1e7cc0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="1a8381d7-63c7-4b44-b8f4-5b6d470b3486"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="dff4c579-d3f8-4e57-8448-0159000b20f8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="7621aca3-36ec-4137-9298-eae223b447b7"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="2605238e-4854-4aec-84ef-317ef06fb210"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="8e8d0ddc-0eee-4d5a-906a-4c2c08addc5b"><mi data-ref="33ae3259-3c9b-4206-bf13-711deb431209">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> items, each with a specific weight and value. You have a knapsack with a maximum capacity <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="09671720-c14f-4103-822d-578f94e3716a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="8c1fb4ea-73b3-472f-97f1-4fb5d54f9f4b"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="e85c46fc-41cf-44f3-9e32-f8d30e4fbd11"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44A TEX-I" data-ref="05d1bda0-c097-4195-a02e-32afae5c727c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="6192d613-6ace-4569-ab45-22957882601e"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="90a604b4-e48d-428a-8dce-1adb53cf5e76"><mi data-ref="9af8b75e-7a46-4527-ac65-4acf4d9a9d79">W</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>. Your goal is to select a subset of these items such that the total weight is less than or equal to <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="58489736-2e45-45af-a8b7-4ac608326850" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="c111c92b-eb63-46d3-b909-6232dad713da"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="15f880d0-cc86-480e-89e9-eee5e51bb5d4"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44A TEX-I" data-ref="497c6cfb-76e8-471e-baf4-0f613e371864"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="0d059103-85f2-4227-bc90-31ec310476f8"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="1ef121fb-7007-453c-96f1-8481263ba6bf"><mi data-ref="6238f748-56a0-4598-bb1a-f955dd3cc211">W</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, and the total value is as large as possible.</p><p data-ref="655b6a98-c09b-45a3-81a3-5e7560992add" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e8c8913f-3b92-464e-9d22-080dac6ec312"></p><p data-ref="e4b94502-7181-465a-a34d-157bde4ac886" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This is the classic 0/1 Knapsack problem, where each item can either be included once or excluded from the knapsack.</p><p data-ref="37b5bd54-ba66-4d07-8ff6-8c05cbf99291" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="461a293b-0de0-4270-970a-374d1a71be57"></p><p data-ref="9b130a7f-1a5a-4509-a982-5755b1afb56a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="d7993198-3500-4f52-8e1c-bf4ceadecaf9">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="8bea6725-1742-4f71-8997-f193fe7da2d3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="df76bd59-e9f4-4d15-9e2d-739f3d6ef418">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="ab330bde-1e99-43df-8266-9ee85a3f74d4" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="3b72dda8-7fde-4715-8281-a24fdeac8375"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="2e582397-7f3f-4d5a-92ee-95844e247baa"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="97a13c7c-da57-48a8-9125-f8252494bf97"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="b9794f75-0376-4fe3-9bcb-1efdc16f9deb"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="c016103d-8fcd-4dda-92fa-be04408e55f7"><mi data-ref="06ed5ba2-46ea-4c4a-959a-9a518d9dbcaf">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of items to consider for the knapsack.</li><li data-ref="2944c385-7471-499d-92db-0069d7909214">The second line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="9511cff9-2b1c-4a8a-bcfb-aacbf7b551d8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="839baa3f-4569-42d3-9439-77f59fae1c16"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="67198e5c-23a2-426c-93a8-64f00b17c803"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="06ce9e8e-0fc4-43b0-82e8-a401dc6fae0d"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="039cbe56-b60d-4543-b35a-0bfe73f099bf"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="9b8d248e-2714-429a-aca0-361b02e2bd51"><mi data-ref="91d8b8bb-baea-422c-b2e1-dd491eacef34">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers, representing the weights of the items.</li><li data-ref="d6b2ed03-72a1-4abe-9cd3-2102e673cdfc">The third line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="33c398ba-9b9d-409a-bee0-b9906c1ddcab" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="3820127f-3350-43e6-a5cd-4c86dd2fbb81"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="e9c635be-8b82-45ac-bc31-57380f7b0110"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="70ccc93a-eaec-45d2-9ac4-1161ca483ad6"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="c952d2fc-f265-4c8b-81b1-54a022bc8236"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6b5e459f-3f0e-49b3-a304-77d45edeb23b"><mi data-ref="5b2eabb7-b324-46ce-8191-e7c2a4c4fa8b">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers, representing the values of the items, corresponding to their weights.</li><li data-ref="54d863a3-ab9e-46f3-8246-faa957fa813b">The fourth line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 117.2%; position: relative;" data-ref="33ae6c48-7b21-48a0-b32c-1fd14f2eb60f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="56eb7e82-f9fa-46ae-afe4-d7f0ddfaed97"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="d331693d-0105-48be-9b2b-5645c17cccb2"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44A TEX-I" data-ref="a68101c2-4149-406d-ae81-0333f9e16c57"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="9031cb00-d4de-4bcc-8ee5-c314394bf1e5"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="c3871f78-7934-4cad-9ad7-4324c3e455ee"><mi data-ref="6c1c2e14-9bcc-4ef1-8bdd-1866c1ee9c18">W</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the capacity of the knapsack.</li></ul><p data-ref="04eaa346-685d-4f3c-a42f-dd9673c673c6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7601a0b5-4e4d-4aa2-93fb-1dfb1c500a68"></p><p data-ref="a08aa154-f10b-48ff-9e23-cd1b1217bd47" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="2367fe70-d6f3-4995-8ea3-3b5d9523377f">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="5a668390-6871-4444-aacb-dcaa3ba0207d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="d8e702f3-45bc-46dc-ad06-953d49d239a2">Print the maximum profit that can be obtained by selecting items such that their combined weight does not exceed the knapsack capacity.</li></ul><p data-ref="4249ad3d-da71-4fcb-88bc-eaae9a501278" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="99004273-5080-4dd6-a894-bd01f015a61f"></p><p data-ref="46782858-fceb-4982-8995-ca09d38aa2b1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="76467412-6cd0-495d-bbaa-4ff38d40ef06">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p><p data-ref="1a1cd774-be16-4d53-bcb8-745f0dca8c99" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-co