f 0s and 1s, where 1 represents a queen.</li><li data-ref="e4be7423-b259-47de-95cd-e7b531d49bbe">If no solution exists, print: "No solution exists for N = &lt;value&gt;".</li><li data-ref="69446ca4-1bf0-4a73-9029-6530bb925d95">Each row of the matrix should be printed on a new line, with space-separated values.</li></ul><p data-ref="f92aad13-672b-4f33-b85d-c689211bf386" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="817bbbe6-b25b-478c-a6f8-67c1529b400a"></p><p data-ref="9767e786-17c8-4108-9f91-f6cafd6c8be6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="1c257de4-88c1-49a1-acac-58433f3f82a2">Note:</strong> Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="c00ae16a-ded9-45f6-841c-5dfe40cd4f1a" data-split-to="c00ae16a-ded9-45f6-841c-5dfe40cd4f1a" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="4a12481d-8058-42bb-bda2-cc74303e351b"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="9bd95815-e726-411b-9b1a-083cfefbcd94" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
